   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "Trade-offs to raise\n\u2022 Freshness vs cost\n\u2022 Lambda (batch+stream) vs Kappa (stream only)\n\u2022 Late data: watermarks\n\u2022 Partition by date for cheap scans\n\u2022 Reprocess raw data when logic changes",
